WEBVTT

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.440
Pardon me.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:55.000
Ah, Saionji.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.570
Good timing.

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.780
Please send this to Mama.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:00.940
Understood.

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:02.910
What's this?

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.450
Yes, it is from Paris.

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:06.550
From Mama?!

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.210
Dear Mayu.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.660
I've designed a summer one-piece.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:20.430
It is yours alone, the only one in the world.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:23.180
It would make me happy if you liked it.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:24.730
From Mama.

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:26.060
It's beautiful!

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.100
I love my mama!

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:30.640
Wonderful, is it not?

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:31.310
Yeah!

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:35.080
Oh, Saionji, give me back
the letter I just handed you.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:37.980
I need to add a <i>thank you, Mama.</i>

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:38.940
Yes.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.610
It really is beautiful.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:44.950
Huh, right!

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:49.540
Eh, a date?

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:50.750
Yes!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.220
Please have a date with me tomorrow!

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:56.450
There is something that I simply must show you!

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:58.550
Ah, tomorrow, huh?

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:02.290
Tomorrow.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:07.140
It seems tomorrow's
weather will be wonderful, too.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.810
It's okay, right, Hanabishi-sama?

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.800
Please, OK?

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:13.770
Eh, well...

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:17.010
I'll come pick you up at 10 tomorrow.

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:19.660
Good night, Hanabishi-sama.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.060
Kaoru!

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:37.260
Why didn't you just say "no"?
You're just doing what she says!

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.000
How nice, a date!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.930
{Big Brother}Onii-chan, go on a date with me next time, okay?

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:45.020
H-Hold on, Chika-chan!

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:45.720
Ah?!

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:46.640
Ah!

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:55.250
Well, isn't it all right?

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:55.730
Eh!

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.110
{Miss Manager}Kanrinin-san?

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:59.620
Kaoru-dono is a man, after all.

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:01.580
It's not really a date...

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:04.070
Right, Aoi-sama?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:04.780
Eh!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:06.660
Ah, yes.

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:10.410
Please be sure to truly
enjoy yourself with Mayu-san.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.160
Aoi-chan!

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:26.850
Eh!

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:28.970
Kaoru-sama!

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:38.550
What is the matter?

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:40.220
Ah, see...

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:42.290
About Mayu-chan earlier.

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:42.860
Ah.

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:47.070
Please go and have a good time.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:51.230
Ah!

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:52.770
S-Sorry!

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:53.910
I didn't mean it like that.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.910
I'm sorry I wasn't able to turn her down.

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:02.040
Mayu-chan just seemed so happy, so...

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:04.510
It's like you, Kaoru-sama.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:05.670
I'm sorry.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.890
Please don't worry about it.

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:11.850
Aoi-chan.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:14.270
But...

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:14.850
Eh!

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:19.650
Next time, please go on a date with me, okay?

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:21.560
Of course!

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:29.490
Honestly.

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.960
Good morning, Hanabishi-sama!

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.620
Wow!

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.810
Whoa!

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:45.050
What a beautiful dress.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:47.570
Mayu Onee-chan, you look like a model!

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:50.970
I'm not that good-looking.

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:53.260
It really looks good, Mayu-chan.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:55.060
Really?

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.390
Well, the clothes really do make the woman.

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.100
Tina-senpai!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.600
What did you say?

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.110
Oh, didn't you hear me?

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:06.010
I said clothes make the woman.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:09.380
My, try saying it again, you beast woman!

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:11.480
Fine, I'll say it all I want!

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:15.080
Clothes make the woman!

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:18.790
I'll have you deported to the jungle!

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:21.250
Fine, try it if you can!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.040
Hey now, you two!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.100
Then we will be going.

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:27.460
Oh, sure.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.880
Well, I'm off.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.390
Have a nice day!

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.510
She's really on my nerve.

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:41.770
Yet...

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:45.860
Saionji-san did go with them, after all.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:46.610
Huh!

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:53.030
Hanabishi-sama, let's have fun today.

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:53.990
Yeah, let's.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.680
By the way, where are we going?

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:58.130
Eh! Ah, um...

00:07:58.130 --> 00:07:59.530
Um...

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:03.170
Saionji, where are we headed?

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.130
We're just driving now.

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:09.040
Oh, you didn't decide where we're going?

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:10.260
W-Well, that is...

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:12.110
Oh, no.

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:17.560
I was overwhelmed with showing the dress and I didn't think of a plan for our date.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:24.050
B-Besides, think of it, this is my first date.

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:28.770
Huh, Saionji, stop the car.

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:35.240
Sorry, Hanabishi-sama,
there's a book that I must buy.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:38.200
I'll be back soon, so please wait for a bit.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.700
Ah, okay.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:43.370
Saionji, please take care of Hanabishi-sama.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.580
Understood.

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:55.250
There it is.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:04.630
My classmate Takahashi-kun
thus began cultivating yellowtail.

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:06.190
I-I see.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.460
We're on a date, after all.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:11.320
I need to make sure that
Hanabishi-sama enjoys himself.

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:14.830
The secret to a fun date is...

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.740
Standing and reading is problematic.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:23.510
I-I'm sitting and reading.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:24.250
Huh?!

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:29.420
I ended up having to buy it.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.820
Mayu-chan!

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:42.600
Motivated by rivalry, my other classmate Satou-kun considered starting the cultivation of abalone.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.310
Eh, things that I like?

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:50.560
Yes, what do you like?

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:53.410
Well...

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:01.420
It's been a while.

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:04.820
But are you really okay
with bowling, Mayu-chan?

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:06.460
Yes, of course.

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:10.060
It's a game that Hanabishi-sama likes.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:12.170
I'm sure that he'll be happy.

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:13.900
Here is your ball.

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:14.880
Good work.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.470
It's heavy!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:23.470
Hey, didn't I tell you to get the lightest one?

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.180
That is the lightest one.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:27.510
No way!

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:29.080
Mayu-chan, you all right?

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:31.190
Y-Yes, I'm all right.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:38.820
Wow, incredible, Hanabishi-sama!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.560
It's just luck.

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:42.490
Well, it's your turn.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:43.280
Okay!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.740
All right.

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:51.210
If I can get a strike with my beautiful form, it'll make Hanabishi-sama very happy.

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:56.340
A-A beautiful form.

00:10:57.940 --> 00:10:59.300
M-Mayu-chan.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:03.260
I have to get a strike for Hanabishi-sama.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.460
D-Don't mind, Mayu-chan.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:45.620
My fingers, my arms, my hips!

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:47.760
Are you all right, Mayu-chan?

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.620
You played three games, after all.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:52.650
A-Absolutely, no problem.

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:55.130
Don't be discouraged.

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:57.530
Fight on, Mayu!

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:59.860
Well, Hanabishi-sama! Next, where...

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:02.330
M-Mayu-chan!

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:04.070
Did something just make a sound?

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:07.670
N-N-N-N-N-Nothing!

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:37.940
This place was just finished last month.

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:40.410
I wanted to come at least once.

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:42.280
Is that so?

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:44.710
What games do you like?

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:47.530
Ah, I don't really care about games.

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:51.590
Eh, really? Then we should
have gone somewhere else.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:54.340
No, not at all.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.500
I don't know about games, though.

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.520
As long as it will make him happy...

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.870
Wow! Amazing!

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.790
Vanilla or chocolate, which would you prefer?

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:42.250
Um...

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:46.540
Oh, please take the one
you prefer, Hanabishi-sama.

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:47.050
Eh!

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:55.350
After we eat the ice cream,
where should we go next?

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:00.320
The park?

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:01.240
Yeah.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.170
Mayu-chan.

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:04.820
Let's ride that.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:05.360
Heh!

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:12.530
Oh, hold on.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:12.950
Heh!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.620
Here, better wipe it.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:17.660
But...

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:19.630
You wouldn't want
to get your dress dirty, right?

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:33.160
Mayu-chan.

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:35.320
Look, the sunset is beautiful.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:41.400
Um, Hanabishi-sama.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:41.860
Eh?!

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.320
Today,

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:47.110
d-did you have a good time with me?

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:53.500
Somehow, it feels like I've
done nothing but trouble you.

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:56.370
I had a good time.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.520
Really?

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:01.250
Yeah.

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:05.300
But, did you have a good time?

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.090
Eh?!

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:09.170
It looked like you were forcing yourself.

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:12.860
There's no need to concern about me.

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:18.100
Eh! Ah!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.560
I wanted you to be happy, Hanabishi-sama.

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:26.020
But despite that, I didn't really know.

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:28.780
I'm sorry.

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:29.990
Mayu-chan.

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:32.340
I'm sorry.

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:46.670
This is incredible.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:52.000
Just the two of us in a restaurant this big.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:55.260
This restaurant belongs to the Miyuki Group, so...

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:59.580
Reserving a place like this
isn't an everyday experience.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:01.850
Oh, maybe it's not unusual for you.

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:09.390
Hey, Mayu-chan.

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:11.570
What do you like?

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:12.460
Heh?!

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:16.190
Something nobody can beat
you at, what you're good at.

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:17.490
Good at?

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:19.900
There's nothing like that for me.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.600
I wonder.

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:24.230
It doesn't have to be anything special.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:28.340
Isn't there anything that you've just kept doing?

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:30.660
I don't have...

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:36.550
A piano...

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:39.220
Mayu-chan, can you play?

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.980
Y-Yes, well...

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.590
When did you start?

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:46.560
When I was five, they bought me a piano.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:49.660
Heh, and you've kept playing since then?

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:50.960
Yes.

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:52.950
You like the piano, don't you?

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:53.530
Heh!

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.990
If you didn't, you wouldn't keep playing.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:00.340
I'd like to hear it.

00:17:00.340 --> 00:17:02.370
It isn't anything great.

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:05.120
I'd like for you to play.

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:03.830
Hanabishi-sama is smiling.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:06.840
He's happy.

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:14.280
I've been able to work this hard because Hanabishi-sama has been here for me.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:20.320
I was able to forget my sadness
by thinking about Hanabishi-sama.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:25.450
But I wasn't able to repay him for that.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:29.000
But today, he was happy.

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:33.830
I was finally able to pay him back, though a little.

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:34.960
Finally!

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:47.840
Thanks for today.

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:49.150
It was fun.

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:52.450
No. I thank you, too.

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:54.920
It was very, very enjoyable.

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:56.780
I see. Thank goodness.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:57.970
Huh!

00:18:58.130 --> 00:18:58.640
Huh!

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:02.580
Ah!

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:10.540
Well, we didn't eat earlier, after all.

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:12.340
I'm sorry.

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:13.500
It's my fault.

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:15.730
It's all right, don't worry about it.

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:18.130
I wonder if we'll make it in time.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:19.410
Eh?!

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:21.510
It's not a high-class restaurant, though.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.970
I know where we can eat delicious food.

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:25.650
Let's go there.

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:26.520
Okay!

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:30.020
I'm home!

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:32.690
Heh! The place with delicious food was...

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:36.940
Right. Food is better when we all eat together!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.780
That's certainly true.

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:45.700
Oh, welcome home, Mayu Onee-chan!

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.870
What, you've come again?

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:52.610
Tonight, I was invited by Hanabishi-sama!

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:53.670
What?

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:57.250
Hey, how did it go today?

00:19:57.680 --> 00:19:59.210
Tell me!

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:01.020
That was, well...

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:06.470
a wonderful day, right, Hanabishi-sama?

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:09.930
Get away from him, you brat!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.560
I don't want to.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.400
Welcome home, Kaoru-sama, Mayu-san.

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:15.900
I'm home.

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:17.870
Um, Aoi-chan.

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:20.360
We haven't eaten yet.

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:27.840
Thank goodness.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:30.160
We've just finished preparing dinner.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:32.580
Oh, it looks delicious!

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:33.720
Hey, Mayucchi!

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:35.960
Don't just up and sit next to Kaoru!

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:38.210
Oh, but this is the guest chair.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:39.820
What do you mean the <i>guest</i>?

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:41.660
That's where I'll sit!

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:42.960
Oh, wait!

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:44.630
Whoa, hey, Tina!

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:47.060
Geez, Tina Nee-chan!

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:49.180
Please stop it, Tina-senpai!

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:51.130
Oh, shut up!

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:52.570
Move it, Mayucchi!

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:53.700
Tina-san!

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:55.150
Sit down.

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:56.140
Yes.

00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:59.510
Well then, everyone...

00:20:59.510 --> 00:21:01.410
{Thank you for the food!}Itadakimasu!

00:22:35.770 --> 00:22:36.970
Kaoru-dono!

00:22:36.970 --> 00:22:37.910
Life can be

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:42.750
prosperous and significant with
tireless effort and time to mature.

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:43.550
Huh!

00:22:43.550 --> 00:22:47.970
Right, for example, like this Chateau Margaux.

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:49.570
You mean this empty bottle?

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:52.860
M-My selected wine is...

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.640
Next time, Ai Yori Aoshi Enishi,

00:22:55.640 --> 00:22:56.990
